<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-020" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd" source-id="s-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-wyd">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">高昭劉皇后諱<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p001:m0006" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_AA">智容</persName>廣陵人也祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p001:m0013" ref="gm4_alk_hn7">玄之</persName>父<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p001:m0016" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_A">壽之</persName>竝員外郎</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">后母<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0002" ref="tob_4dh_0fe">桓氏</persName>夢吞玉勝生<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0009" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_AA">后</persName>時有紫光滿室以告<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0018" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_A">壽之</persName><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0020" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_A">壽之</persName>曰恨非是男<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0027" ref="tob_4dh_0fe">桓</persName>曰雖女亦足興家矣后每寢臥<rs id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:u0040" type="unresolved">家人</rs>常見上如有雲氣焉年十餘歲歸<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0055" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">太祖</persName>嚴正有禮法家庭肅然宋泰豫元年殂年五十歸葬<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0077" ref="egx_xax_4ic">宣帝</persName>墓側今泰安陵也門生<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0088" ref="ud8_x1t_413">王清</persName>與<rs id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:u0091" type="unresolved">墓工</rs>始下鍤有白兔跳起尋之不得及墳成兔還棲其上昇明二年贈竟陵公國夫人三年贈齊國妃印綬如太妃建元元年尊諡<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0141" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_AA">昭皇后</persName>三年贈后父金紫光祿大夫母<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0156" ref="tob_4dh_0fe">桓氏</persName>上都鄉君<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0162" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_A">壽之</persName>子<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0165" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_AB">興道</persName>司徒屬<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0170" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_AC">文蔚</persName>豫章內史<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0176" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_AD">義徽</persName>光祿大夫<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-liuzhirong-ancestry-wyd:p002:m0182" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_AE">義倫</persName>通直郎</p>
</text>
